200~1.	Executive Summary
 Hospital Management System provides user-friendly interface for hospital admin user to manage their patient’s and doctor’s data. Even patients can access this portal. 

2. Requirements - This application should have user registration and login system
     - Hospital admin should be able to add, edit and delete patient information. 
    Search functionality should be provided based on patient name, Id and other relevant        information.
    -Ability to view patient’s medical history including diagnosis, medications.
    - Hospital admin should be able to upload medical documents such as lab reports or images. Once Hospital admin uploads reports, patient should be able to view it.
   - Hospital admin should be able to view and schedule appointments for patients.


 Use story 1 – Home screen to create patient registration /login and hospital admin login. 


